      },
      "text": "1. **Pricing and markets in tech:** How does Uber surge pricing work? How does Google Ads auction operate? Why do two-sided platforms (eBay, Airbnb) face a chicken-and-egg problem? These are economics questions."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#009",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:economics:00-overview, git-history:economics:00-overview]",
