        "title": "Economics and Game Theory - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. **Auction theory:** Google's AdWords, Vickrey-Clarke-Groves (VCG) mechanisms, spectrum auctions. Nobel 2020 (Milgrom, Wilson) directly from spectrum auction design."
    },
    {
